OL,4,CUS rapper postpones two arena shows    
OL,5,Cafter Manchester evacuation            
OL,6,GUS rapper Don Toliver has postponed    
OL,7,Gtwo shows in London this week, after   
OL,8,Ghis concert in Manchester on Sunday    
OL,9,Gwas evacuated when an "unknown         
OL,10,Gsubstance" was released into the crowd.
OL,12,FToliver was due to play The O2 on      
OL,13,FMonday and Wembley Arena on Tuesday,   
OL,14,Fbut Live Nation said his "stage and    
OL,15,Fproduction equipment remains in        
OL,16,FManchester and cannot be moved in      
OL,17,Ftime".                                 
